Sītā hears Rāma-voiced cry and urges Lakṣmaṇa onward --- Lakṣmaṇa declares Rāma invincible without rival --- Lakṣmaṇa cites entrusted guard and rākṣasa māyā cries --- Sītā accuses Lakṣmaṇa of craving her and serving Bharata --- Sītā threatens to enter Gōdāvarī fire or poison --- Lakṣmaṇa invokes forest witnesses against harsh speech --- Lakṣmaṇa entrusts Sītā to deities and leaves for Rāma